WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:05.560
Uh, there is a rule which is that there was
supposed to be extra consideration given to

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:12.679
military veterans in immigration cases, meaning
that if you have a military veteran, uh, who

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:17.290
does not have legal status or maybe was here
on a visa that has expired and they have not

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:21.990
been able to get citizenship as a result of
being in the military yet that special consideration

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:26.980
is given to them when you process them through
the immigration, uh, sort of court system

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.420
and adjudication system.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.529
And unfortunately the Donald Trump administration
is not following that rule.

00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:36.079
More and more non citizens are being deported.

00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:38.820
Who are veterans of the American military?

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:42.880
How many we don't actually know because record
keeping has been so atrocious.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:49.340
The government accountability office found
that 250 veterans are subject to removal.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.340
92 have been deported.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:55.210
We've deported nearly a hundred military veterans.

00:00:55.210 --> 00:01:02.399
The issue here is not legality issue here
is that officials are going against their

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:06.549
own guidelines about how this is supposed
to be handled.

00:01:06.549 --> 00:01:11.320
There are two memos since 2004, uh, addressing
exactly this issue.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:17.220
There's a memo from 2015 which says that any
time you are looking at deporting a military

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:21.140
veteran, it must be set for a higher review.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:25.960
If you are going to deport a military veteran,
you need a special document explaining why

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.600
is it that you are deporting this military
veteran.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:30.020
This is not being done.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.421
Okay, and there's this meme that we've dealt
with many times before, which is that the

00:01:35.421 --> 00:01:38.290
right supports the troops and the left doesn't.

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:40.930
And of course this could not be further from
the truth.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:44.909
I've said before, yeah, I'm on the left and
I support the troops.

00:01:44.909 --> 00:01:51.060
I don't want to send them to military conflicts
as political pawns where they may be injured

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.640
or killed or traumatized for life.

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:59.180
That's how I support the troops by really
making military action the absolute last resort

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.860
and using it so sparingly.

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:06.579
Only when we really are a, an immediate danger,
not fighting political wars the way Republicans

00:02:06.579 --> 00:02:09.280
have been doing for decades at this point
in time.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:13.800
Healthcare, I support the troops by making
sure that, or wanting at least I can't make

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:18.900
sure personally and the system is not working
well, but demanding and asking for veterans

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.290
to really get good medical care.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:24.830
And it's got to happen with immigration as,
and it is not happening here.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:31.660
The Republicans love veterans as props, props
on stages, props on aircraft carriers when

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:36.890
they declare mission accomplished, dead veterans
that they can honor and use for political

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:37.890
gain.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:41.060
But when it comes to just treating them like
real people, recognizing their sacrifice,

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:45.000
when we consider their immigration status,
when we consider the health care that we provide

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.730
to them, when we consider job opportunities
that we are furnishing, that is where all

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:52.360
of a sudden the right does not care.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:58.710
I wish the support the troops brigade on the
right simply supported them for real.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:01.200
And uh, it's disgusting that this is going
on.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:06.620
And this is an example of why we can't allow
Trump to use Twitter to set the narrative

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.499
and to distract from really serious things
that are going on.

